            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Now the refund queue's own job reads that table. Its preconditions are\ndischarged from the table's schema and constraints, which the contract\nput there, so whoever maintains the job needn't re-check the data:</span></span>"
